-wh40k-translator-implant-low-gothic = Requires knowledge of Low Gothic.

ent-WH40KBaseTranslatorImplant = translator implant
    .desc = A subdermal chip that translates speech.

ent-BasicTauCetiBasicTranslatorImplant = basic Low Gothic translator implant
    .desc = Lets the wearer understand spoken Low Gothic.
ent-TauCetiBasicTranslatorImplant = advanced Low Gothic translator implant
