ent-BluespaceLifelineImplant = bluespace lifeline implant
    .desc = On activation or death, sends the wearer's body to Winter Solstice with no way back.
ent-FakeMindShieldImplant = fake mindshield implant
    .desc = While active, shows a false mindshield indicator on security HUDs.
ent-MieyoTrackingImplant = MMC tracking implant
    .desc = Sends a signal to the Mieyo corporate radio channel when the wearer enters critical condition or dies.
ent-ViperTrackingImplant = Viper Group tracking implant
    .desc = Sends a signal to the private Viper Group radio channel when the wearer enters critical condition or dies.
ent-RadioImplant = Underground radio implant
    .desc = Provides access to the Underground radio channel without a headset.
ent-RadioImplantCentcomm = CentCom radio implant
    .desc = Provides access to the CentCom radio channel without a headset. Authorized for CentCom personnel.
ent-RadioImplantCivilian = civilian radio implant
    .desc = Provides access to civilian radio channels without a headset.
ent-RadioImplantTsf = TSF radio implant
    .desc = Provides access to the TSF and civilian radio channels without a headset.

ent-JawsOfLifeLeftArm = left J.W.L cybernetic arm
    .desc = Lets the wearer pry open doors, even while they are powered.
ent-JawsOfLifeRightArm = right J.W.L cybernetic arm
    .desc = { ent-JawsOfLifeLeftArm.desc }
ent-SpeedLeftLeg = left S.P.E.E.D cybernetic leg
